OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand scattered showers through the
OL,7,Fevening, a few of these heavy at
OL,8,Ffirst. Showers increasingly confined
OL,9,Fto the coast overnight with longer
OL,10,Fclear spells developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FDry and bright for many in
OL,13,Fthe morning, but a few showers around
OL,14,Fthe isles. Cloudier afternoon with
OL,15,Fsome showers before a band of heavy
OL,16,Frain pushes east in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
